                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This data file contains the data used for the longitudinal analyses for the mood and aemotional reactivity measures (POMS) within the adolescent and young adult sample in the article 'Mood and Emotional Reactivity of Adolescents During the COVID-19 Pandemic: Short-Term Effects and Long-Term Effects and the Impact of Social and Socioeconomic Stressors'. <div><br>\n\n<p></p>\n</div><div>Files are accessible to the authors of the study. Interested parties can request access by e-mailing green@essb.eur.nl or crone@essb.eur.nl. When requesting the data, please explain why you would like to access the files.<br><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
                }
